cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this archived Pyomo version of MicroGridsPy, please cite it as below."
title: "MicroGridsPy-Pyomo: archived Pyomo implementation of the MicroGridsPy mini-grid planning model"
abstract: >-
  Archived Pyomo-based implementation of MicroGridsPy, an open-source model for the
  optimal sizing and dispatch of hybrid mini-grids in remote and underserved areas.
  This repository preserves the codebase underlying the MicroGridsPy publications up to
  and including the 2023 release line. Development has continued in a ground-up
  Linopy-based redevelopment at https://github.com/MicroGridsPy/MicroGridsPy.
type: software
version: "2.1"
date-released: "2026-09-22"
license: EUPL-1.2
repository-code: "https://github.com/MicroGridsPy/MicroGridsPy-Pyomo"
url: "https://microgridspy-docs.readthedocs.io/en/latest/"
keywords:
  - energy
  - mini-grid
  - rural electrification
  - optimization
  - pyomo
  - energy access
